ospec: 1
# Grocery Restocking
> Households choose how often they buy items, and orders are created for them automatically.

platform: web, mobile
market: Nigeria
currency: NGN
language: English

## Users
- **Household** {#household}: A family that buys groceries every week or month.
- **Store admin** {#store-admin}: Keeps products and supplier prices up to date.

## Features

### Recurring orders {#recurring-orders}
Households choose how often they want an item, and an order is created automatically each time.
for: [[Household]]
priority: must
uses: [[Order]], [[Product]]
must:
- An item can repeat every 1 to 8 weeks. {#c-91ab}
- Skipping the next order takes one tap. {#c-04de}
- When payment fails → retry 3 times over 3 days, then pause the order and tell the household. {#c-77f1}
done when:
- [ ] A household sets Milk to repeat weekly and an order appears the next week. {#c-3f2a}
- [ ] Skipping the next order removes it and keeps the schedule. {#c-b310}
- [ ] A failed payment retries and then pauses the order. {#c-52c9}

### Pay with a local method {#local-payments}
Households pay with a card or bank transfer through Paystack.
for: [[Household]]
priority: must
needs: [[Paystack]]
done when:
- [ ] A test payment succeeds and the order is marked paid. {#c-1e08}

## Data

### Order {#order}
- household: [[Household]]
- items: many [[Order line]]
- status: one of waiting, paid, delivered, cancelled
- repeats: yes/no — set when the order came from a schedule

### Order line {#order-line}
- product: [[Product]]
- quantity: number
- price: money

### Product {#product}
- name: text
- price: money
- supplier: text

## Screens

### My orders {#my-orders}
for: [[Household]]
shows: [[Order]]
actions: skip next order, change how often, pause
device: both

## Integrations
- **Paystack** {#paystack}: Takes card and transfer payments. needs keys: PAYSTACK_SECRET, PAYSTACK_WEBHOOK_SECRET

## Environments

### staging {#staging}
purpose: Try changes before customers see them.

### production {#production}
purpose: What households use.
protected: yes
needs keys: PAYSTACK_SECRET, PAYSTACK_WEBHOOK_SECRET, SMTP_HOST

## Limits
- speed: Pages open in under 2 seconds on a mobile connection. {#c-6a12}
- privacy: Household addresses are visible only to the store and the courier. {#c-9d40}

## Questions
? Should recurring purchases charge automatically? {#q-auto-charge}
- (a) Yes, on the delivery day
- (b) No, ask the household to confirm each time
answer: a

## Assumptions
- Deliveries happen Monday to Saturday. (assumed by Origine) {#a-delivery-days}

## Decisions
- 2026-09-21 — Failed payments retry 3 times over 3 days. (@isaiah) {#d-retry}
